# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# /api/* proxies to the FastAPI backend on the Hetzner VPS via api.seocostadelsol.com
# (DNS-only A record → 142.132.168.30, Nginx + Let's Encrypt, auto-renew via certbot).
# Using a hostname instead of a raw IP means the cert remains valid if the IP changes.
/api/*  https://api.seocostadelsol.com/api/:splat  200

# SPA fallback — every other request renders the React app.
/*      /index.html                                 200
